The '''Fishing Trophy''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[sword]].

==Obtainment==
The Fishing Trophy was rewarded to everyone who placed in the top 1,000 in the 2025 Fishing Tournament.

==Upgrading==
The Fishing Trophy cannot be upgraded and can only be enchanted using [[Common Scroll]]s, just like any other non-upgraded weapon.

