==Trivia==
* Even though the Fishing Trophy counts as a [[Swords|Sword]], its shape and name have no sword-like characteristics at all.
* The Fishing Trophy is the only sword that deals no damage in any way whatsoever.
* The Fishing Trophy does not help in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]] or grinding at all.
* The Fishing Trophy can be considered the second rarest sword in the game, below the admin-exclusive [[Triple Dark Blade]].
* This is one of the two [[Swords]] that cannot be [[Upgrading|upgraded]], alongside [[Dog Blade]].

